1000A6F2 aTrainableChann db 0Ah
1000A6F3                 db '                        "TRAINABLE CHANNEL" - MODE:',0Ah
1000A727                 db '"TRAINABLE CHANNEL" - compression of another portion of informati'
1000A768                 db 'on taking into',0Ah
1000A777                 db 'account all earlier compressed information -context. For example:'
1000A7B8                 db ' you transmit',0Ah
1000A7C6                 db 'by modem a corrected version of the text transmitted yesterday. I'
1000A807                 db 'n this case',0Ah
1000A813                 db 'it',27h,'s possible to expect 100-time compression, in other word'
1000A84E                 db 's, only the latest',0Ah
1000A861                 db 'information was transmitted. Besides, there',27h,'s a possibility'
1000A89C                 db ' to maximize',0Ah
1000A8A9                 db 'compression of the data of a certain type. For example, create a '
1000A8EA                 db 'context from',0Ah
1000A8F7                 db 'the files *.txt and use this txt-context to compress txt-files. I'
1000A938                 db 'n addition,',0Ah
1000A944                 db 'such an approach ensures additional data protection against non-a'
1000A985                 db 'uthorised',0Ah
1000A98F                 db 'access -it',27h,'s impossible in principle without knowledge of t'
1000A9CA                 db 'he whole background',0Ah
1000A9DE                 db 'data being decoded. In unpacking the context should be the same a'
1000AA1F                 db 's in packing.',0Ah
1000AA2D                 db 'The context file is renewed each time it is used. For example: yo'
1000AA6E                 db 'u packed the',0Ah
1000AA7B                 db 'text of an agreement using the context, the context file was rene'
1000AABC                 db 'wed and can',27h,'t',0Ah
1000AACA                 db 'be used to unpack the received archive but the receiving party (i'
1000AB0B                 db 'n our example',0Ah
1000AB19                 db '"office") has a yesterday',27h,'s context identical to yours up t'
1000AB54                 db 'o the latest',0Ah
1000AB61                 db 'packing, that is why the transmitted archive in the office will b'
1000ABA2                 db 'e unpacked',0Ah
1000ABAD                 db 'and the context file will be renewed and identical to yours. If y'
1000ABEE                 db 'ou want to',0Ah
1000ABF9                 db 'ban renewal of the context file set it in Read_Only.',0Ah
1000AC2E                 db '                        EXAMPLE:',0Ah
1000AC4F                 db 'vbn b john"office.jon john.txt - John transmitted to the office a'
1000AC90                 db ' renewed text',0Ah
1000AC9E                 db 'vbn r john"john.ofs            - the office unpacked the transmit'
1000ACDF                 db 'ted text.',0Ah
1000ACE9                 db 'In the given example the name of the context file is convenient t'
1000AD2A                 db 'o be',0Ah
1000AD2F                 db 'interpreted as address, for John it has the name "office.jon" and'
1000AD70                 db ' in the',0Ah
1000AD78                 db 'office the name "john.ofs".',0Ah
1000AD94                 db '                   Press any key to continue ......',0
